---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import {ownerData} from '../../lib/server';
import {accents,sections,themeOf} from '../../lib/model';
const info=await ownerData(Astro.locals.db!,Astro.locals.user!.id);if(!info.profile)return Astro.redirect('/dashboard/');const theme=themeOf(info.profile.theme);
---
<Shell title="디자인 편집" dashboard noindex><header class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</span><h1>내 페이지에 어울리게.</h1><p>기본 테마의 색과 섹션을 바꿔 보세요. 저장 후 미리보기에서 확인할 수 있어요.</p></header><div class="design-workspace"><section class="panel"><form method="post" action="/api/theme/" data-api="theme" data-track id="theme-form" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="version" value={info.profile.updated_at} data-profile-version /><input type="hidden" name="theme" value={JSON.stringify(theme)} /><fieldset><legend>포인트 색</legend><div class="color-options">{Object.entries(accents).map(([value,accent])=><label class="color-choice"><input type="radio" name="accent" value={value} checked={theme.accent===value} /><span class="swatch" style={`background:${accent.light}`}></span>{accent.label}</label>)}</div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>밝기</legend><div class="field-pair"><label class="check"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="light" checked={theme.mode==='light'} />밝게</label><label class="check"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="dark" checked={theme.mode==='dark'} />어둡게</label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>섹션과 순서</legend><p class="help">선택을 끄면 숨겨집니다. 화살표로 순서를 바꿀 수 있습니다.</p><ol class="section-order" data-section-order>{theme.order.map(key=><li class="order-item" data-section={key}><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name={`section-${key}`} checked={!theme.hidden.includes(key)} />{sections[key]}</label><div><button type="button" class="outline" data-move="up" aria-label={`${sections[key]} 위로`}>↑</button><button type="button" class="outline" data-move="down" aria-label={`${sections[key]} 아래로`}>↓</button></div></li>)}</ol></fieldset><p data-feedback class="feedback" role="status"></p><button class="button" type="submit">디자인 저장</button></form></section><section class="preview-panel"><div class="preview-toolbar"><h2>페이지 미리보기</h2><div role="group" aria-label="미리보기 크기"><button type="button" class="outline" data-preview-width="desktop" aria-pressed="true">데스크톱</button><button type="button" class="outline" data-preview-width="mobile" aria-pressed="false">모바일</button></div></div><div class="preview-window" data-preview-size="desktop"><iframe title="내 포트폴리오 미리보기" src="/dashboard/preview/" data-live-preview></iframe></div><p class="help">저장한 초안을 표시합니다. 실제 게시본은 ‘내 페이지’에서 게시할 때 갱신됩니다.</p></section></div></Shell>
